                "text": "On #WomensEqualityDay, we commemorate the anniversary and passage of the 19th Amendment. But this year, SCOTUS took away our constitutional right to reproductive health care. Today and always, I will support equality for all across Michigan and this country. The work continues. https://t.co/yNNdHTHqBO",
