                "text": "Today, I held a press conference w/ state & local leaders to discuss ongoing efforts to combat gun violence in Detroit.\n\nGun violence is a public health crisis. We have taken important steps in the right direction, but the fight is not over. There is much more work to be done. https://t.co/8saVUJ0VOd",
